WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Multi-agent collaboration coordinates one task;
Context Tree carries settled decisions into the next.

00:05.500 --> 00:12.000
The Agent reads only task-relevant context
it is authorized to use.

00:12.000 --> 00:30.000
Shared decisions define where the change belongs
and what must remain unchanged.

00:30.000 --> 00:47.000
New durable knowledge reaches the Tree only after
source-backed, independent review.

00:47.000 --> 01:00.000 position:72% size:50% align:middle
Once approved, the update becomes
the next Agent's starting point.
